eak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も一日頑張るぞって時も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心が穏やかになれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒されます(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生のメリーゴーランド"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海の見える街"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風の通り道"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アシタカせっ記  ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん好きな曲があるのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに好きなのは、「 あの夏へ  」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という曲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉がなくても、感動して涙が出そうに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってしまいます。（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに空を見ながら聴くのが、好きです^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/29/7551618/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の空は、四季の中で一番好き(*^_^*)！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/29/7551618/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたがしみたいにフワフワ真っ白な雲と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこまでも鮮やかな青い空との"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コントラストがすごく素敵"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/29/7551618/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/29/7551618/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/29/7551618/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは、最近、どんな曲を聴いていますか？＾＾ ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら、教えてくださいっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Melodix見てくださった方有難うございます ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜更かしさせてしまった方はごめんね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、本当にああいうの苦手です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にもGyao!さんで、理想の告白というのをやって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしくて泣いてしまったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのときは、ななみん監督がカメラの横に立って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことをしてくれて^^"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/29/7551618/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんを見ながらやったら言えたんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は言えなかった～（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう私はゴセイナイトで十分なんですヽ(；_；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうどうにもしないでくださいヽ(；▽；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(；▽；)ノふぎゅぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.